---

<section class="py-16 sm:py-20" aria-labelledby="referral-heading">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
    <div
      class="bg-white rounded-[2rem] p-7 sm:p-10 lg:p-12 border border-black/5 shadow-sm grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 lg:gap-12 items-center"
      data-reveal="fade-up"
    >
      <div class="text-center lg:text-left">
        <p
          class="text-7xl sm:text-8xl lg:text-9xl font-semibold text-amber leading-none tracking-tight"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
          $1,000
        </p>
        <p
          class="mt-3 sm:mt-4 text-xs uppercase tracking-[.25em] text-teal font-bold"
        >
          Referral reward
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[.25em] text-teal font-bold">
          Refer a friend
        </p>
        <h2
          id="referral-heading"
          class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-semibold mt-3 leading-tight"
        >
          Send a neighbor. Get $1,000.
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-4 sm:mt-5 text-slate-600 text-lg leading-relaxed">
          When someone you refer installs a system with Great Lakes Solar, we
          send you $1,000 — no cap, no expiration. Just our way of saying
          thanks for spreading the word.
        </p>
        <a
          href="/contact"
          class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center bg-amber text-ink rounded-full px-7 py-3.5 font-bold hover:bg-amber/90 transition-colors"
        >
          Refer a Friend
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
